<title>UK: Lonrho says JCI merger talks at early stage.</title>
<headline>Lonrho says JCI merger talks at early stage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lonrho Plc said merger talks with JCI Ltd were continuing, but added the negotiations were still at an early stage.</p>
<p>Lonrho also said it had no plans to divest its stake in Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd at this point.</p>
<p>The comment follows a press report here over the weekend that the Ashanti holding was being sized up by South Africa's Gencor Ltd.</p>
</text>
